  <wpt lat="46.13667162433385" lon="-67.58022169145096">
    <name>Road riding</name>
    <cmt>generic</cmt>
    <desc>Start of long stretch of paved riding along St. John's River. Traffic should be pretty light.</desc>
    <sym>Dot</sym>
    <type>generic</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="45.42720036252863" lon="-65.40536449854334">
    <name>Route Alternative</name>
    <cmt>control</cmt>
    <desc>Riders who do not want to take the paved Fundy parkway can take the dirt Big Salmon River Road starting here that parallels the parkway and meet up with the route further along.</desc>
    <sym>Dot</sym>
    <type>checkpoint</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="45.658613895668" lon="-65.13001561210861">
    <name>Route Alternative</name>
    <cmt>control</cmt>
